Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope that we'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Npaths, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In our path, I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that I wanna take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head forth and.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.76,0:02:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chowbro, it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that'll be enough whining out of you,\Nlittle lady I don't like eating humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But a mink, that might be worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.56,0:02:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not yummy at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let her go, Barrel! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot's not gonna taste good anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not a real rabbit, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.86,0:03:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.77,0:03:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I will pass the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.36,0:03:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really think I'm gonna let her go,\Nkeep your mouth shut, you big furball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be joining mama's\Ncollection of freaks soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaks, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll fit right in,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,okay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is going according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure to be in heavy\Npoint when she chained me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can escape in an\Ninstant by transforming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I really goofed out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joe's going to scold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been six hours since I\Nused Monster Point yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so I've got that in my arsenal, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the broth's ready for some mink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that books\Ncontain infinite worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and i'm inclined to\Nagree this one contains
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,a man-eating lion with a human face very
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,rare a manticore it's\Ncalled it used to live in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,impelled down but when blackbeard attacked
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the prison two years\Nago this little darling
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,escaped lord glove it\Nmoved and this one here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,is my pride enjoy isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,it beautiful uh but it's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,alive in the book indeed\Njust as they appear
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and these beasts will\Nnever age a day as it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,should be the contents\Nof a book have no right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to go changing themselves\Nbehind one's back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,this library is full of\Ncreatures from around
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.26,0:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the world oddities of every shape and eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,tucked away from my\Nperusal sweet all thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to the extraordinary\Npower of my son mont door
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we recently picked up a\Nreal-life centaur from
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,punk hazard we even found\Na griffin in the south blue
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.14,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and then there's this one a long limbs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,human someone help let me out humans too
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom, there's something I\Ncouldn't help but notice your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,country here is graced by people\Nof many races but of course
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,this is my dream after all all\Nthe races living in harmony
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,yes but there's one race that\Ni haven't seen at all and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't help wondering about\Nit and i think i would notice
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If they were here, the giant\Ntribe I mean I've seen some
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,very large humans but that's\Nall for a country founded on
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,diversity I'm curious about\Nthe omission is there a reason
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How funny? Somehow you seem to miss\Nthem. Well, I haven't been here long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,yes what is it we um uh\Ncaptured the enemy uh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we brought them here\Nand the two of them from
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,that crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The weather's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,rotten, but make yourself at home, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I got nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,think I'd get to see the\Nreal Germa double six.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Reiju and Ichiji look so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Big fan, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting so worked up over\Na little comic strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares if they look flashy or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling the shots, not Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, what page was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's page 55.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,55.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I lick the look on their\Nfoolish little faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna keep us like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take a shower at\Nleast, I'm covered in syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's disgusting that sounds lickety\Nsweet if you ask me, candy girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can complain to mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,transponder
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hello there, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I commend your effort making it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.26,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this big, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go. Wait for Saji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll wreck your whole\Ndamn island if I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, you've still\Ngot some spirit, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was disappointed to see you\Ndidn't bring your whole crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You had some bold words\Nfor me on Fisherman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have you forgotten about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get there, I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll make Fisherman\NIsland my territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm still gonna\Nkick your ass someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're only here\Nto take Soji back with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've heard enough\Nof your meaningless bluffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you're just hiding from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come show yourself if you're so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight you, right here and right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come face me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't even spent\Na year in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And you request an\Naudience with an emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Learn your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, my officers are more than capable\Nof killing you without my assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a deal, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to be generous and let\Nyou waltz out of here with your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but you have to give up on Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji and Pudding's\Nwedding is important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It must go smoothly, so I\Ncan't have you ruining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,While we're having fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:11:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll sit there quietly, and we'll see\Nhow I'm feeling once this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if you spoil what I've been looking\Nforward to, I'll really make you suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll wish that you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me. Remember when we\Nfirst spoke down on Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.82,0:11:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You ate all of the candies\Nthat were supposed to be mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,then you offered the\Nstash of treasure you got
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.24,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,from King Neptune in an\Nattempt to appease me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you a deal—we've\Ngot a bunch of treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.58,0:11:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I give it to you, then\Ncan we call it even?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,even
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what we found in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Something very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to ask for it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island's legendary treasure\Nchest passed down for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called the Temate Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised. Surely Neptune\Nmust have given it up by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a national treasure, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see\Nwhat secrets are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing beats a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,good treasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I always say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll forgive you for\Nstealing my candy when
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone's gathered for\Nthe wedding tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll open the tomato box at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't have fun at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cassidy's coming back with me! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me talk to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's friends with my crew! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Any daughter of mine would\Nclearly be your enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.02,0:13:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough babble from you,\Nspeaking of which, young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you killed my other daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She gave me your Vivi card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the token of our friendship anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm signing the piece\Nof my mama's Vivi card,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you're ever in trouble\Nyou can use it to find
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,her and she'll help you\Nout if that ever happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.76,0:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Lola!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola's doing fine out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That was her message.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All that she told me was\Nthat her mother was a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting one\Nof the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:14:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola said that if I was in trouble to\Nshow you the Vivi card and you'd help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never do a damn thing for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's fine, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want her dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know where I can find\Nher, you better tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got an assassination coming her way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, that idiot\Nstill thinks of us as family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A child who doesn't respect her\Nparents' wishes is useless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Little ingrate,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,she spurned the most profitable political
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,marriage I've ever set up\Nand ran off like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.62,0:14:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lastly and most importantly, I\Nwill allow one of you to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The only woman Absalom is\Nallowed to marry is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.26,0:14:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You make a cute couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should totally hook it up, girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to save you\Nbecause we're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Loa, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.16,0:15:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is you, Loa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we can meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see my mama, tell\Nher I said hi, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know I was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If she just got married as I said, do you\Nhave any clue how powerful I would be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have conquered them\Nall Kaido and Whitebeard
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and red-haired Jinx would\Nhave fallen before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for her I'd\Nalready be king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat burglar Nami, you're\Ngonna help me kill Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll tell me where she is,\Nor I'll beat it out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making stupid excuses, Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola didn't get married,\Nand that's on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't become king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's on you; nothing else to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here and fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not backing down, even\Nif you are an emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking Sanji back no matter what;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn this all\Naround and make you sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.92,0:17:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The tiger mink's totally\Nwrecking up the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you mean jaguar mink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro, so you've already\Ninfiltré le Shit? Calic. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure is funny, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think that would go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got no bargaining chips\Nand you're deep in mama's Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight me if you're so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.94,0:17:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, fam?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through, coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, unglaze, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We got trouble at the treasure room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We got an intruding coming\Nthrough an intruder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You must mean, yeah, that I did my\Njob, but I ain't brushing my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please get out\Nof here while you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's made fools of us enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he moved you the other whole way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:18:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul King coming to you live\Nfrom the Whole Cake Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,\Nlet's get ready to rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not mad, Mama? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that squirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I care if he wants to bite me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why be angry, Zeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much to look forward to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's in my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally I'll have germ as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the tomate box\Nwill be good and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve only the finest cake there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.74,0:19:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When I just think of tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It washes away all my sorrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,With a plan this good, there's\Nno way that I'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A joyous day, I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.16,0:20:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's an intruder\Nnear the repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The treasure room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.06,0:20:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the finest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.36,0:20:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet the rotten bastard is\Ntrying to nab my tomate box.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.86,0:20:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others won't be hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom promised me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:20:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get married, the\NBaratie will be fine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I don't want\Nto leave my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least no one will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.28,0:21:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I be grateful?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding is all I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make her sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta put on a smile for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you decide to marry\Nme, I won't let it be hell
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could hurt a sweet girl like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have to be some kind of monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.16,0:21:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you happy.\NPress, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just regular Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know me, the romantic chef, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.29,0:21:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shower you with love!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola? Really? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the Straw Hat Girl\Ngot a Vivre card from her,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so the homies in the\Nforest couldn't fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She had them working for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.06,0:22:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to break this to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but Mama rejected the wedding\Ndress you picked out yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.48,0:22:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll expect you to wear the\None she picked out instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama planned out everything\Nafter the wedding as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the itinerary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding, it's\Nstill raining out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.16,0:22:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on her mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.16,0:22:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, as long as you do what you're\Ntold, everything will work out just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.68,0:22:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of yourself as my little doll,\Nbecause that's all you are, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.82,0:22:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good girl. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.26,0:23:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mama would never kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.22,0:23:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're family, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to choose who I marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll understand someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they let something like this\Nhappen the day before the tea party?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him! Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.64,0:23:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.44,0:24:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going down on whoever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,YAAAAAAAH! Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.74,0:24:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.86,0:24:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.98,0:24:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.82,0:24:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.48,0:24:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He went downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.82,0:24:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on the third floor of the Red\NBean Bomb Cake, near the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:25:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a slippery little\Nmiscreant, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.68,0:25:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to go to him as a guy\Nthat's evil, play. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.14,0:25:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's enough guards\Nfor me for a whole lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally decided to face us, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.36,0:25:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all things considered, I\Nsuppose I shouldn't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd all thinned him out considerably.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I've never seen a creature like\Nyou. We got all sorts of things here in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.60,0:25:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,this country but you are one-of-a-kind
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,oh I agree can't wait to show you to mama
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.74,0:26:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,C 'est bon, General, c 'est bon!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.02,0:26:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one entrance\Nto the room, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.58,0:26:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he doesn't manage to steal that\Ndresser, he won't be able to escape you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Et l'Ençon sera sans ça!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you guard that dark loosely,\Neverything should be too charmant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds simple enough. Count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.90,0:26:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's assume he beats the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.26,0:26:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When he comes out and tries to\Nescape, should I kill him? No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.98,0:26:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The man in question is un skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.52,0:26:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will want him, be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.56,0:26:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him, but don't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.02,0:26:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.02,0:26:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro told me all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.88,0:27:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're infused with human souls\Ncourtesy of Big Mom's remarkable power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.96,0:27:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I know what\Nmakes you soldiers tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.78,0:27:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's the power of soul, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.90,0:27:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not powerful, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.22,0:27:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too big, at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.36,0:27:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got him on the run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.46,0:27:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.30,0:27:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No way to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.00,0:27:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.28,0:27:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.18,0:27:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.68,0:27:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.48,0:27:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.80,0:28:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.71,0:28:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.88,0:28:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to know what\Nmy stage name is, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.20,0:28:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What you got, it ain't real, Snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.24,0:28:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It runs away, scared, that\Nsloppy, slapped-on, spirity horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.88,0:29:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When you hear my soul scream, it\Nknocks you off your feet, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.56,0:29:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.36,0:29:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.27,0:29:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fancy seeing you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.22,0:29:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the occasion, Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.50,0:29:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.52,0:29:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.08,0:29:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.25,0:29:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is making me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.68,0:29:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't talk with the enemy right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.60,0:29:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being very quiet, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.56,0:29:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you open the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.02,0:29:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just needed to say something to\NLuffy and Nami before the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever floats your boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.68,0:30:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll put in a bookmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.54,0:30:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.12,0:30:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This has gone all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.40,0:30:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We went to the coast, like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.26,0:30:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.46,0:30:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get him in trouble, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.50,0:30:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all beaten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.28,0:30:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Muffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.96,0:30:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.04,0:30:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers and sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.80,0:30:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They've done terrible things to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.10,0:30:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.72,0:30:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't make it\Nto the coast like I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.94,0:30:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.64,0:30:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't blame you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.28,0:31:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pick up your head, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.90,0:31:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they whispering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.02,0:31:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.38,0:31:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.28,0:31:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I met with Sanji, and he proposed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.70,0:31:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.90,0:31:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But still.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:32:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Sanji only said\Nthat to be nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.72,0:32:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not what he really wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.90,0:32:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.08,0:32:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just causing everyone trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.74,0:32:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.94,0:32:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.64,0:32:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.46,0:32:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,going to marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.16,0:32:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.52,0:32:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pudding, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.00,0:33:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, goodbye.
